@startuml
participant Scheduler
participant Executor
database Evidence
actor Human
Scheduler -> Executor: approved task execution
Executor --> Scheduler: failure with original evidence
Scheduler -> Evidence: preserve result and failure category
alt eligible read-only repair within limit
Scheduler -> Executor: prepare scoped new request
Executor --> Human: exact request for human review
Human -> Executor: authenticated grant
Scheduler -> Executor: bounded repair execution
Executor --> Scheduler: new result and validation
else security, approval, uncertain write or exhausted budget
Scheduler -> Evidence: block and escalate
end
@enduml
